---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="For Families & Care App | Otter Homecare" description="Stay gently in the loop with the Otter Care App.">
<header class="phero"><div class="wrap"><div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> · About · For Families & Care App</div><h1>Stay connected to the moments that matter</h1><p>Choosing care for a loved one is a big decision. We're here to support, guide and reassure you through every stage — not just to provide care.</p></div></header>
<section class="section app"><div class="wrap"><div class="reveal"><p class="lede" style="margin:0 0 22px">Our Care App keeps the whole family gently in the loop — wherever they are.</p><div class="fl"><span class="ix">01</span><div><h4>See who's visiting today</h4><p>Know when your carer has been and when they're due.</p></div></div><div class="fl"><span class="ix">02</span><div><h4>Read real visit notes</h4><p>From breakfast choices to how they're feeling — recorded with care.</p></div></div><div class="fl"><span class="ix">03</span><div><h4>Access care records anytime</h4><p>View care plans, assessments and updates easily.</p></div></div><div class="fl"><span class="ix">04</span><div><h4>Know medication's been taken</h4><p>Confidence that medication's been given and needs are met.</p></div></div></div><div class="app-stage reveal"><div class="phone"><img src="/img/ff72ba_92c3196bddda4a5f87fda89ca88bb38b~mv2.png" alt="The Otter Care App showing a visit summary"></div><div class="app-co co1"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><div><b>Visit complete</b><small>Notes added · 09:32</small></div></div><div class="app-co co2"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2.5" y="8.5" width="19" height="7" rx="3.5"></rect><line x1="12" y1="8.5" x2="12" y2="15.5"></line></svg></span><div><b>Medication given</b><small>On time, every visit</small></div></div><div class="app-co co3"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 21s7-6.3 7-11a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 4.7 7 11 7 11z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5"></circle></svg></span><div><b>Carer on the way</b><small>Sarah arrives 8:30</small></div></div><div class="app-co co4"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"></path></svg></span><div><b>Next visit booked</b><small>Tomorrow, 9:00am</small></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section bg-cream tmt"><div class="wrap"><div class="head-c reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Here for you, every step of the way</span><h2>More than care — real support for families</h2><p class="lede">Many of us have been family carers ourselves. We know the worries, and the relief of feeling truly supported.</p></div><div class="funding reveal">
<div class="fund"><h3>Kind, no-pressure advice</h3><p>Free, friendly consultations with no obligation. We listen, answer honestly, and help you explore the best options.</p></div>
<div class="fund"><h3>Clear, transparent information</h3><p>Costs and funding, what to expect, how our care works and how to get started — all in plain language, no jargon.</p></div>
<div class="fund"><h3>Practical help beyond care</h3><p>Home safety advice, equipment recommendations, and help navigating Local Authority or NHS support routes.</p></div>
<div class="fund"><h3>A family-led approach</h3><p>We treat every client the way we'd want our own parents and grandparents to be cared for.</p></div>
</div></div></section>
<section class="section bg-sky tmt"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px"><div class="head-c reveal"><span class="eyebrow">The Care App</span><h2>Using the Otter Homecare app</h2></div><div class="video-embed reveal" data-yt="vnTnK0pfv0c" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Play video: Using the Otter Homecare app"><img src="/img/poster-care-app.jpg" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='https://img.youtube.com/vi/vnTnK0pfv0c/hqdefault.jpg'" alt="The Otter Homecare Care App" loading="lazy"><span class="playbtn"><span></span></span><span class="vlabel">Watch: Using the app</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section bg-beige"><div class="wrap"><div class="head-c reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Going further for families</span><h2>We make it easy — for everyone</h2></div><div class="funding reveal"><div class="fund"><h3>We make it easy for everyone</h3><p>We remove friction wherever we can: large-print documents on request — right down to your invoices — and family surveys offered four ways (online, on paper, over the phone, or in person), so no one is ever left out. We do things <em>with</em> people, not just <em>for</em> them.</p></div><div class="fund"><h3>A complaint is a gift</h3><p>We genuinely want to hear when something isn't right. We welcome concerns, promise it will never affect your care, come out in person — even at weekends if it's serious — and close the loop by telling you what's changed as a result.</p></div><div class="fund"><h3>Relationships that outlast the contract</h3><p>Our care doesn't end when a contract does. Our founder still visits former clients who've moved into care homes, just to check in — because the relationships matter more than the arrangement.</p></div><div class="fund"><h3>A real care app, not a clipboard</h3><p>We're around 90% paperless, with electronic care records, signatures and route-planned visits — less paper, less driving, and a live window into your loved one's care through the Care App.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section book"><div class="wrap" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;display:block;text-align:center"><div class="reveal" style="max-width:36ch;margin:0 auto"><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#9fc4bf">Free, no-obligation assessment</span><h2 style="margin:14px 0 12px">Let's find the right care, together</h2><p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:26px;color:#bfe0dc">Speak to a real, local person today — never a call centre.</p><div style="display:flex;gap:13px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn btn-clay btn-lg" href="/#book">Book a free assessment</a><a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="tel:01225690022" style="background:transparent;color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.5)">Call 01225 690022</a></div></div><div class="book-trust reveal"><div class="bt-ticks"><span>Free, no-obligation home visit</span><span>A care plan built around you</span><span>We usually reply the same day</span></div><div class="bt-stars"><span class="s">★★★★★</span> Rated <b>9.4</b> by families on homecare.co.uk</div></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
